# Git sync for wow-addons

Remote: https://github.com/Henrik8210/wow-addons.git (branch `main`).

After completing meaningful work on GemOrder or GemOrderTest:

1. Commit all relevant changes with a clear message (why, not just what).
2. Push to `origin/main` unless the user asked not to push.
3. Bump `## Version:` in the relevant `.toc` when shipping a new release build.

Do not leave addon code only on disk or in the WoW AddOns folder — the repo is the source of truth.
